{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1461477-how-to-see-the-future","id":1461477,"title":"How to see the future?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-25T21:41:57-07:00","id":1461477,"title":"How to see the future?","content":"I am thinking of playing a Tremere from house Rodolfo, which specializes in divination. I was wondering if anyone knew all the different methods a Tremere vampire could use for seeing the future, doing divination, fortune telling and all that kind of stuff. I am playing V20, though some revised stuff is allowed too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1926-lilitha","name":"Lilitha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T21:56:24-07:00","id":1461479,"title":"","content":"Mechanically it will have to involve auspex, I think. Thematically it can be haruspex, or divination via organs. Organs from people when the Tremere do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-26T00:16:59-07:00","id":1461493,"title":"","content":"Just quickly tossing out a few ideas I found on the wiki:<br /> <br /> Auspex has advanced level (6+) powers that involve varying levels of precognition; level 6 has Prediction, level 9 has Precognition.<br /> <br /> It looks like the path of Oneiromancy may unlock some options for visions of the future in dreams. If you want to get more creative/recklessly suicidal, and have an accommodating Storyteller, you might be able to use Spirit Manipulation on a spirit of time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-26T03:42:32-07:00","id":1461540,"title":"","content":"I don't think I will get advanced disciplines since it is a new character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1926-lilitha","name":"Lilitha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-26T05:24:23-07:00","id":1461547,"title":"","content":"In direct terms of traits in the character sheet, Auspex and that's it. By RAW it have a chance of giving premonitions, but it is ST fiat instead of any level under your control. You can add divinatory tricks and they may help, but its totally on your Storyteller's hands. Outside of that in Vampire divination is strictly a Thin Blood ability, not something for the Tremere.<br /> <br /> Your other option if the ST allows is to get something to help you, using Background to acquire a magical item from another game line. The ideal would be a Time Wonder using Mage rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}